  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rajasthan IDF PFM/Procurement Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the grant will be to assist the Finance Department, Government of Rajasthan (GoR) in its efforts to build strong financial management and public accountabilty framework, enhance the timeliness and quality of spending by streamlining and strengthening critical procurement and financial processes, including preparation and approval of the budget, budget execution and release of funds through Treasury, internal controls, accounting, financial reporting and procurement. Within the long term objectives of assisting the Department of Finance, Government of Rajasthan in its efforts to build stong financial management and public accountability framework, the specific objectives of this project are to enhance the timeliness and quality of spending by streamlining and strengthening critical procurement and financial management processes, including preparation of budget, budget execution and release of funds through Treasury, internal controls, accounting, financial reporting and procurement.</narrative>
  </description>
